92186749374 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749374 1083 #uuid "47b8c61d-4a0b-5c94-b5c6-85730e3a17df" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749375 1080 "\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{19}\\right)" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749375 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749375 1083 #uuid "4a01fd0b-73cb-5a3f-85fd-bbef5cd79413" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749376 1068 #edb/ref 17592186749383 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749376 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749376 1071 "Simplify.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sin\\left(48^\\circ\\right)\\tan\\left(24^\\circ\\right)}{\\left(1-\\cos\\left(24^\\circ\\right)\\right)}\n$$" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749376 1072 #uuid "4b3268cc-698f-5401-8d94-c9f98fb4685d" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749376 1074 "Write $s=\\sin\\left(24^\\circ\\right)$ and $c=\\cos\\left(24^\\circ\\right)$. The **double-angle formula** gives $\\sin\\left(48^\\circ\\right)=2sc$.\n\n Also, $\\tan\\left(24^\\circ\\right)=\\frac{s}{c}$.\n\nRewrite the quotient ratio and cancel. Use $s^2+c^2=1$, factor the difference of squares, then cancel the matching binomial.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{2sc\\frac{s}{c}}{(1-c)} &=\\frac{2s^2}{(1-c)} \\\\ &=2\\frac{1-c^2}{(1-c)} \\\\ &=2\\frac{(1-c)(1+c)}{(1-c)} \\\\ &=2(1+c) \\\\ &=2\\left(1+\\cos\\left(24^\\circ\\right)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAll cancellations use nonzero factors in the original expression." 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749377 1068 #edb/ref 17592186749373 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749377 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749377 1071 "Simplify.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sin\\left(78^\\circ\\right)\\tan\\left(39^\\circ\\right)-1}{\\sin\\left(39^\\circ\\right)+\\cos\\left(39^\\circ\\right)}\n$$" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749377 1072 #uuid "5361be42-5ed7-5adf-8a76-6512902e8c29" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749377 1074 "Write $s=\\sin\\left(39^\\circ\\right)$ and $c=\\cos\\left(39^\\circ\\right)$. The **double-angle formula** gives $\\sin\\left(78^\\circ\\right)=2sc$.\n\n Also, $\\tan\\left(39^\\circ\\right)=\\frac{s}{c}$.\n\nRewrite the quotient ratio and use $s^2+c^2=1$ to obtain a difference of squares. Factor before cancelling.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{2sc\\frac{s}{c}-1}{s+c} &=\\frac{2s^2-1}{s+c} \\\\ &=\\frac{s^2-c^2}{s+c} \\\\ &=\\frac{(s-c)(s+c)}{s+c} \\\\ &=s-c \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(39^\\circ\\right)-\\cos\\left(39^\\circ\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAll cancellations use nonzero factors in the original expression." 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749378 1075 #edb/ref 17592186749369 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749378 1075 #edb/ref 17592186749387 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749378 1075 #edb/ref 17592186749391 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749378 1075 #edb/ref 17592186749401 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749378 1075 #edb/ref 17592186749402 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749378 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749378 1077 "selection" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749378 1078 #edb/ref 17592186749402 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749378 1079 #uuid "647bbd3e-425d-51e8-b719-d15b3a4a9a0e" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749379 1080 "2\\cot\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{19}\\right)" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749379 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749379 1083 #uuid "6662a77a-f4a9-517b-8f98-c2edf162f7c0" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749380 1068 #edb/ref 17592186749386 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749380 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749380 1071 "Simplify.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sin\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{19}\\right)}{\\cos^2\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{19}\\right)}\n$$" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749380 1072 #uuid "6735129e-3b3d-5f85-9610-818aaff3755c" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749380 1074 "Write $s=\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{19}\\right)$ and $c=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{19}\\right)$. The **double-angle formula** gives $\\sin\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{19}\\right)=2sc$.\n\n\n\nCancel one factor of the squared denominator, then rewrite the quotient.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{2sc}{c^2} &=\\frac{2s}{c} \\\\ &=2\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{19}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAll cancellations use nonzero factors in the original expression." 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749381 1080 "2\\cos^2\\left(24^\\circ\\right)" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749381 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749381 1083 #uuid "6fab64ec-672d-5cad-b805-6b8c20e17d4e" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749382 1068 #edb/ref 17592186749371 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749382 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749382 1071 "Simplify.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sin\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{7}\\right)}{\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{7}\\right)}\n$$" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749382 1072 #uuid "70f1092c-9cc3-5947-9982-63dbf57e5091" 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749382 1074 "Write $s=\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{7}\\right)$ and $c=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{7}\\right)$. The **double-angle formula** gives $\\sin\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{7}\\right)=2sc$.\n\n\n\nExpand the doubled sine and cancel the common factor.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{2sc}{c} &=2s \\\\ &=2\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{7}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAll cancellations use nonzero factors in the original expression." 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749383 1075 #edb/ref 17592186749381 13194139546289 17592186576411 true] [17592186749383 1075 #edb/ref 175